BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[David Rumsey Map Center / Stanford University Libraries] Emergent
  Properties: Decennial Reflections on Collections
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260911T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260911T170000
DTSTAMP:20260911T165617Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-53923391076842-53923487670125@local-events
DESCRIPTION:In 2026 the David Rumsey Map Center celebrates its tenth year
 —a moment to reflect on how the Center has added value to scholarship on
  campus and around the world. Our collections are vast and not bounded by 
 geography\, spanning the 15th century to the present. Yet over the last de
 cade\, certain materials have repeatedly resonated with the students\, ins
 tructors\, and researchers who frequent the Center. Emergent Properties br
 ings together a selection of highlights from deep within the collections o
 f\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-09-11 09:56 PDT
LOCATION:David Rumsey Map Center (Green Library)
END:VEVENT
